1880
01:17:48.760 --> 01:17:50.013
Was he an escapist?

1881
01:17:51.050 --> 01:17:52.910
'Cause I think about escapism a lot.

1882
01:17:52.910 --> 01:17:55.360
'Cause I think I have that in me.

1883
01:17:55.360 --> 01:17:57.380
