1901
01:18:48.710 --> 01:18:50.950
because you don't have to sit with yourself

1902
01:18:50.950 --> 01:18:52.840
and deal with yourself.

1903
01:18:52.840 --> 01:18:57.180
And you see the pain and the tension between that pole,

1904
01:18:57.180 --> 01:19:00.010
that drive inside of him and the fact that

1905
01:19:00.010 --> 01:19:02.410
he has a wife and he has a kid

1906
01:19:02.410 --> 01:19:07.410
and the, what's the right word for it?

1907
01:19:08.170 --> 01:19:09.170
The kind of...

1908
01:19:11.450 --> 01:19:15.760
He tortures himself over his relationship with child

1909
01:19:15.760 --> 01:19:18.720
in that, he's not sure he's being a good dad

1910
01:19:18.720 --> 01:19:21.430
and he so desperately wants to be a good dad.

1911
01:19:21.430 --> 01:19:23.820
And yet, you know, he has this huge life

1912
01:19:23.820 --> 01:19:25.700
