1919
01:19:42.680 --> 01:19:45.340
You know, having lived on the road for eight months

1920
01:19:45.340 --> 01:19:47.240
a year for seven to eight years,

1921
01:19:47.240 --> 01:19:48.753
as a lonely planet author.

1922
01:19:50.250 --> 01:19:51.660
Eight, nine months and you're chasing

1923
01:19:51.660 --> 01:19:53.770
like cool destinations and going weirder

1924
01:19:53.770 --> 01:19:56.500
and weirder places, that I call it weirder and weirder.

1925
01:19:56.500 --> 01:20:00.480
More unusual places, it's a better way of putting it

1926
01:20:01.530 --> 01:20:05.040
to get further and further away from the known world,

1927
01:20:05.040 --> 01:20:07.383
or our own culture and our own selves.

1928
01:20:09.350 --> 01:20:14.020
You know, a lot of people call that the dream job,

1929
01:20:14.020 --> 01:20:16.990
most people wouldn't last one year doing that.

1930
01:20:16.990 --> 01:20:19.300
You know, to last seven or eight years was a lot for me.

1931
01:20:19.300 --> 01:20:21.360
There's people out there still doing it that I know,

1932
01:20:21.360 --> 01:20:23.840
although the pandemic has halted a lot of those contracts.

1933
01:20:23.840 --> 01:20:27.163
But most people would not last one year.

1934
01:20:28.540 --> 01:20:31.010
You know, the New York times had the 52 places journalists,

1935
01:20:31.010 --> 01:20:33.820
and a lot of them have written about it afterwards.

1936
01:20:33.820 --> 01:20:36.710
And a lot of them were, I mean, so far,

1937
01:20:36.710 --> 01:20:39.120
I think they were pretty exhausted by the end

1938
01:20:39.120 --> 01:20:42.710
