1939
01:20:42.710 --> 01:20:44.830
Like lonely planet, lonely writer.

1940
01:20:44.830 --> 01:20:46.600
Well it's like Jeff Gordinier said

1941
01:20:46.600 --> 01:20:49.320
about like needing a healthier lifestyle after years

1942
01:20:49.320 --> 01:20:51.100
