01:25:56.820 --> 01:26:00.790
I separate the offense as like someone who doesn't

2065
01:26:00.790 --> 01:26:03.820
understand the harm that deep fakes could cause.

2066
01:26:03.820 --> 01:26:08.820
The problem is, it is kind of a hand grenade.

