2145
01:29:21.757 --> 01:29:23.910
and that's part of his term and his charisma.

2146
01:29:23.910 --> 01:29:25.713
I don't think he'd want the one point two.

2147
01:29:25.713 --> 01:29:28.710
I cannot look away from this guy.

2148
01:29:28.710 --> 01:29:31.440
Everything that I see him in every interview.

2149
01:29:31.440 --> 01:29:33.170
He was on Rogan, I think he's gotten a Rogan

