that was completely off the rails.

2167
01:30:18.260 --> 01:30:20.050
Okay yeah, and I just thought maybe

2168
01:30:20.050 --> 01:30:21.020
it's gonna be too weird for me,

2169
01:30:21.020 --> 01:30:23.310
but it's not it's like right up my alley.

2170
01:30:23.310 --> 01:30:26.560
The one thing I'll say, and I'll spin it back to you,

2171
01:30:26.560 --> 01:30:29.770
is that he lives in his childhood home.

2172
