01:30:51.177 --> 01:30:53.290
In David Choe's fashion,

2180
01:30:53.290 --> 01:30:55.320
I'm gonna reveal something of myself

2181
01:30:55.320 --> 01:30:56.723
in this David Choe review.

2182
01:30:59.800 --> 01:31:01.220
