01:31:05.610 --> 01:31:06.700
There's good memories there,

2186
01:31:06.700 --> 01:31:08.350
there's less good memories there.

2187
01:31:09.270 --> 01:31:11.110
There's bad memories there.

2188
01:31:11.110 --> 01:31:14.920
And, but you know, we need more space

2189
01:31:14.920 --> 01:31:17.340
and like looking at the real estate market

