2192
01:31:21.230 --> 01:31:22.705
it's just like terrifying for me.

2193
01:31:22.705 --> 01:31:23.840
(laughs)

2194
01:31:23.840 --> 01:31:25.505
And so this opportunity came up,

2195
01:31:25.505 --> 01:31:27.400
the renters had moved out

2196
01:31:27.400 --> 01:31:29.230
