in David Choe fashion.

2206
01:31:48.083 --> 01:31:49.370
I mean he just turns the whole house into an art studio.

2207
01:31:49.370 --> 01:31:51.720
It's like paint everywhere.

2208
01:31:51.720 --> 01:31:53.340
It's bizarre.
Clay.

2209
01:31:53.340 --> 01:31:55.530
I couldn't like think straight in a place like that,

2210
01:31:55.530 --> 01:32:00.450
but it just gave me permission own my situation,

2211
01:32:00.450 --> 01:32:01.700
