2220
01:32:25.510 --> 01:32:27.557
It's not just like going deep to try to be cool.

2221
01:32:27.557 --> 01:32:29.010
No.
It's like authentic,

2222
01:32:29.010 --> 01:32:29.843
it works.

2223
01:32:29.843 --> 01:32:30.676
It's so authentic.

2224
01:32:30.676 --> 01:32:33.190
