and he's so original that you're riveted by it.

2230
01:32:51.560 --> 01:32:55.010
And so these episodes essentially work like triptychs like,

2231
01:32:55.010 --> 01:32:57.760
they're a couple, usually three, interviews

2232
01:32:57.760 --> 01:33:00.810
