02:30:01.320 --> 02:30:04.560
Well going out into the world and coming home fulfilled,

3542
02:30:04.560 --> 02:30:08.420
I think, and being available to your kid

3543
02:30:08.420 --> 02:30:09.710
for their needs in those moments,

3544
02:30:09.710 --> 02:30:13.010
I think is, is really more important.

3545
02:30:13.010 --> 02:30:16.543
And I would say also, you know, to extend that a little bit,

3546
02:30:16.543 --> 02:30:19.680
and as a parent of kids who are older,

3547
