3552
02:30:33.030 --> 02:30:35.220
And thinking more about that, you know,

3553
02:30:35.220 --> 02:30:38.750
I think will help you understand the profundity of it,

3554
02:30:38.750 --> 02:30:40.920
and that you really do want to be there for all of it

3555
02:30:40.920 --> 02:30:42.733
to embrace all of those changes,

3556
02:30:43.700 --> 02:30:44.930
when you're with them to not wish

3557
02:30:44.930 --> 02:30:46.740
they were that younger version of themselves,

3558
02:30:46.740 --> 02:30:48.420
but to meet them where they currently are,

3559
02:30:48.420 --> 02:30:52.300
and to do this, we really have to be mindful and present.

3560
02:30:52.300 --> 02:30:54.970
And that might be easier when the world is stopped

3561
