3663
02:36:38.330 --> 02:36:40.490
You know, how can you excavate that?

3664
02:36:40.490 --> 02:36:41.920
Get honest with yourself,

3665
02:36:41.920 --> 02:36:43.750
work through it so that you can just be comfortable

3666
02:36:43.750 --> 02:36:44.860
with who you are.

3667
02:36:44.860 --> 02:36:48.806
I mean, I think that's the real weight room here.

3668
02:36:48.806 --> 02:36:51.333
You know, the emotional weight room.

3669
02:36:51.333 --> 02:36:52.166
I like that.

3670
02:36:52.166 --> 02:36:52.999
You can go into the gym

3671
02:36:52.999 --> 02:36:56.660
